      <description sparkle:format="plain-text">Download and upload limits now use macOS sliders with clearer scales. Peer limits show five reference marks.
The speed-mode panel stays anchored while the change is applied, and you can reopen it while waiting.
Fixed a player freeze when seeking and replaying after a video ended. Full-screen controls fade with Reduce Motion support.
Improved keyboard focus after choosing a folder, cancelling a magnet link, or saving a task to the queue.</description>
